<title>GERMANY: RWE Energie sees 96/97 profit transfer up.</title>
<headline>RWE Energie sees 96/97 profit transfer up.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German energy group RWE Energie AG, a unit of utility RWE AG, said on Wednesday it expected to be able to transfer a higher profit to its parent for the current 1996/1997 business year.</p>
<p>The company transferred 370 million marks to RWE in the 1995/1996 business year, ended June 30.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
